1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,001
Os 5 passos da infusão.

2
00:00:03,672 --> 00:00:06,112
Preparar a infusão tem 5 passos

3
00:00:06,112 --> 00:00:07,406
. Para lembrar,

4
00:00:07,406 --> 00:00:08,686
pense em cinco palavras com a

5
00:00:08,686 --> 00:00:09,560
letra P:

6
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:10,360
planejar,

7
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,001
preparar,

8
00:00:11,001 --> 00:00:11,641
preencher,

9
00:00:11,641 --> 00:00:14,245
posicionar e pôr para funcionar.

10
00:00:15,672 --> 00:00:17,131
Primeiro passo:

11
00:00:17,131 --> 00:00:18,361
planejar.

12
00:00:18,361 --> 00:00:20,281
Aqui você confere o material e

13
00:00:20,281 --> 00:00:22,288
se prepara para começar.

14
00:00:22,714 --> 00:00:24,274
Segundo passo:

15
00:00:24,274 --> 00:00:26,210
preparar a seringa.

16
00:00:26,265 --> 00:00:28,265
Você passa o medicamento do frasco

17
00:00:28,265 --> 00:00:29,710
para a seringa.

18
00:00:30,009 --> 00:00:31,620
Terceiro passo:

19
00:00:31,620 --> 00:00:33,246
preencher o tubo.

20
00:00:33,246 --> 00:00:35,086
Você enche o tubo do conjunto

21
00:00:35,086 --> 00:00:37,566
de infusão com o medicamento.

22
00:00:37,884 --> 00:00:39,284
Quarto passo:

23
00:00:39,284 --> 00:00:41,027
posicionar a cânula.

24
00:00:41,027 --> 00:00:42,837
Você insere a cânula na pele

25
00:00:42,837 --> 00:00:45,411
da barriga e conecta o tubo.

26
00:00:45,589 --> 00:00:46,892
Quinto passo:

27
00:00:46,892 --> 00:00:48,807
pôr a bomba para funcionar.

28
00:00:48,807 --> 00:00:51,127
Você inicia a infusão contínua

29
00:00:51,127 --> 00:00:52,887
e coloca a bomba no estojo

30
00:00:52,887 --> 00:00:54,380
de transporte.

31
00:00:54,628 --> 00:00:56,548
Os próximos vídeos mostram cada

32
00:00:56,548 --> 00:00:57,632
passo.

33
00:00:57,632 --> 00:00:58,352
Depois deles,

34
00:00:58,352 --> 00:00:59,392
você vai ver o que fazer

35
00:00:59,392 --> 00:01:00,722
no dia a dia:

36
00:01:00,722 --> 00:01:02,162
as opções da bomba,

37
00:01:02,162 --> 00:01:03,602
a hora do banho e as

38
00:01:03,602 --> 00:01:05,340
trocas de material.

39
00:01:05,915 --> 00:01:07,533
No próximo vídeo:

40
00:01:07,533 --> 00:01:08,253
passo um,

41
00:01:08,253 --> 00:01:09,506
planejar.

